## 2. Where authentic Stradivari violins are usually bought (no fixed public “add to cart” price)

Contact or monitor these for **private treaty** or **auction** stock (no specific instrument guaranteed available on a given date).

| Organization | Role | URL |
|--------------|------|-----|
| J & A Beare | Major dealer; certificates; historical Strad/Guarneri sales. | https://www.beares.com/ |
| Ingles & Hayday | Private sales + London auctions (search noted **March 2026** auction calendar). | https://ingleshayday.com/private-sales/ |
| Tarisio | Auction house specializing in stringed instruments; frequent high-end sales. | https://tarisio.com/ |
| Sotheby’s | Fine musical instruments sales. | https://www.sothebys.com/ |
| Christie’s | Fine musical instruments (watch upcoming London/NY sales). | https://www.christies.com/ |

