## 6. Limitations of this file

- No single database indexes every private sale worldwide.
- “Buyable” for multimillion-dollar Stradivari usually means **negotiation with a dealer or registration for a specialist auction**, not a consumer checkout page.
- Always obtain **independent expert authentication** before treating any instrument as a genuine Stradivari.
